{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31738","headline":"冬月长安雨中见终南雪 · 贾岛","name":"冬月长安雨中见终南雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋节新已尽，雨疎露山雪。\n西峰稍觉明，残滴犹未绝。\n气侵瀑布水，冻着白云穴。\n今朝灞滻鴈，何夕潇湘月。\n想彼石房人，对雪扉不闭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}